     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p>Could you post the full example please ?</p>\r\n<p><br>\r\n</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tmb-...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tmb-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Cole Monnahan (<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mon...@uw.edu</a>) &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mon...@uw.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, January 4, 2018 1:24:14 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> TMB Users<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [TMB users] Re: NaN from ADREPORT for simple model</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div></div>"
