     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Jan 4, 2018 at 9:48 AM, Kasper Kristensen <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ka...@dtu.dk</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
